Condition : 92 - C19.	In respect of Site C;
A. No development (excluding demolition) shall take place until details of a Sustainable Urban Drainage Scheme, including measures for (i) the minimisation of water run-off from the site, aiming for greenfield levels, and (ii) the conservation and reuse as appropriate of other water supplies in the buildings have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  
